{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43539","headline":"建元寺西院寄李员外纵联句 · 皇甫曾","name":"建元寺西院寄李员外纵联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寄隐霜台客，相思粉署人。\n诚知阡陌近，无奈别离频。\n夜色迷双树，钟声警四邻。\n散才徒仰鲍，归梦远知秦。\n雨带清笳发，花惊夕漏春。\n招摇随步锡，髣髴听行轮。\n要路推高足，空林寄一身。\n盛名知独擅，良会忆相亲。\n稍涤心中垢，都遗陌上尘。\n今宵此堂集，何事少遗民。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}